{"c":"473094","n":"TRUSOVICKÝ POTOK 1","t":"P","s":"MS","o":"Domašov nad Bystřicí","url":"473094-trusovicky-potok-1","stav":"2026-10-10","popis":"Revír tvoří podrevíry:\n\n1. vlastní tok Trusovický potok 18 km 7,35 ha\nGPS Z: 49°39'25.460\"N, 17°17'13.881\"E, K: 49°48'46.576\"N, 17°21'15.492\"E\nPřítok Moravy. Od jezu v Bohuňovicích u kulturního domu až k pramenům včetně všech přítoků.\nVšechny přítoky a tok Trusovického potoka od silničního mostu I/46 v Horní Loděnici až k pramenům jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán.\n\n2. zatopený lom v k. ú. Dalov 0,25 ha\n(GPS 49°46'37.162\"N, 17°20'40.233\"E)\n\nV celém revíru je pstruh obecný celoročně hájen.","delka":18,"rozloha":7,"lat":49.735006,"lon":17.338458,"mo_web":"https://pstruzilihenbela.webnode.cz/","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"domasov@mocrs.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":null,"max":null,"haj